# ZMK Round Display Status Module Configuration

config ROUND_DISPLAY_STATUS
    bool "Enable Round Display Status Module"
    depends on ZMK_DISPLAY && LVGL
    default n
    help
      Enable custom status display module for round displays.
      Shows Hello World, battery status, and BLE connection info
      optimized for 240x240 circular displays.

if ROUND_DISPLAY_STATUS

config ROUND_DISPLAY_UPDATE_INTERVAL
    int "Display update interval in seconds"
    default 5
    help
      How often to update the display content in seconds.
      Lower values provide more responsive updates but use more power.

config ROUND_DISPLAY_REFRESH_RATE
    int "Display refresh rate in milliseconds"
    default 50
    help
      How often to refresh the LVGL display in milliseconds.
      50ms = 20 FPS. Lower values are smoother but use more power.

endif